meta {
  name: Clientside Ecommerce API
}

docs {
  Customer storefront API collection.

  Open this `bruno` folder in Bruno, select the Local environment, then set `shopId` and `phone`.

  Run Auth / Verify Phone OTP after you have a code. That request saves `accessToken` and `refreshToken` into the environment.

  Every request sends `x-shop-id` from the collection. Catalog, cart, checkout, and orders need that shop UUID.

  Storefront routes are also mounted without the `/api` prefix (`/storefront/...`). This collection calls `/api/storefront/...`.

  POST /api/storefront/cart and cart item create, update, and delete return 410 CART_SERVER_RETIRED. Price lines with Cart Preview, then checkout with `items` in the body.

  Keep Bruno's cookie jar enabled. Location Check sets the serviceability cookie used by checkout.
}

auth {
  mode: none
}

headers {
  x-shop-id: {{shopId}}
}
